{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118460","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118460/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118460/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118460/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118460","id":4246519109,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HL1F","number":118460,"title":"AudioEffectRecord accesses shared state from 3 threads with zero synchronization","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:28:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:14Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\n`AudioEffectRecordInstance` is accessed from three threads with no synchronization primitives:\n\n1. **Audio thread** (`process()`, line 37-52): Writes `ring_buffer_pos`, reads/writes `ring_buffer` via `ptrw()`, reads `is_recording`.\n2. **IO thread** (`_io_thread_process()`, line 72-80; `_io_store_buffer()`, line 82-89): Reads `ring_buffer_pos`, reads `ring_buffer` via `ptrw()`, writes `recording_data`, reads `is_recording`.\n3. **Main thread** (`get_recording()`, line 199-278): Reads `recording_data`.\n\nNone of these shared variables (`is_recording`, `ring_buffer_pos`, `ring_buffer_read_pos`, `ring_buffer`, `recording_data`) use atomics, mutexes, or any synchronization. The IO thread calling `ring_buffer.ptrw()` can trigger copy-on-write while the audio thread is writing. `recording_data.push_back()` can reallocate memory while `get_recording()` iterates on the main thread.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start audio recording via `AudioEffectRecord`.\n2. Stop recording and call `get_recording()` while the IO thread is still processing.\n3. Potential crash from data corruption or use-after-free.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — three-thread race condition visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g